    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it is suffocating. i feel like a fraud. like i'm just pretending to be a person every time i talk to my partner or go to work. and the \"making the noise quieter\" thing... i don't know. it just feels like there's no way to actually fix it. i've tried everything and the grayness just stays. it's like i'm stuck in this loop and there's no exit.",
